WrapperToken::previewWrap
├── when ptAmount is zero
│   └── it should return zero
├── when wrapped amount rounds down to zero
│   └── it should return zero
└── when wrapped amount is greater than zero
    ├── it should return (ptAmount * 10 ** DECIMALS / exchangeRate) rounded down
    ├── given exchangeRate equals 10 ** DECIMALS
    │   └── it should return ptAmount
    ├── given exchangeRate is greater than 10 ** DECIMALS
    │   └── it should return fewer wrapped tokens per PT than one-to-one
    └── given exchangeRate is less than 10 ** DECIMALS
        └── it should return more wrapped tokens per PT than one-to-one
